 "notes": "Two pact families share the standard GATT pair and envelope. pact_h605b is HDMI-sync/camera-calibration oriented (0xA9 extension namespace, USB/HDMI/sound-source commands); pact_h6099 is TV-backlight oriented (op-type colour model, sleep/timer/white balance). Scene/DIY blobs are cloud assets. H8604/H8098 are goodsType aliases. Matter subsets listed per family."
}